@baseUrl = http://localhost:7075
@batchId = workshop-001

### Start the CSV batch
# @name startBatch
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/batch/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "batchId": "{{batchId}}",
  "blobName": "sample-input.csv",
  "pageSize": 2,
  "maxParallel": 2
}

### Check the orchestration status (run repeatedly until Completed)
GET {{startBatch.response.body.$.statusQueryGetUri}}
